.TH "nvme_init_set_features_bp_write_protect" 9 "nvme_init_set_features_bp_write_protect" "October 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
nvme_init_set_features_bp_write_protect \- Initialize passthru command for Boot Partition Write Protection Config
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "void" nvme_init_set_features_bp_write_protect
.BI "(struct libnvme_passthru_cmd *cmd "  ","
.BI "bool sv "  ","
.BI "__u8 bp0wps "  ","
.BI "__u8 bp1wps "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "cmd" 12
Passthru command to use
.IP "sv" 12
Save value across power states
.IP "bp0wps" 12
Boot Partition 0 Write Protection State (BP0WPS)
.IP "bp1wps" 12
Boot Partition 1 Write Protection State (BP1WPS)
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Initializes the passthru command buffer for the Set Features command with
FID value NVME_FEAT_FID_BP_WRITE_PROTECT
